[2025-11-26 08:46:36,216] DEBUG in messages: r={'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/249969729', 'assets_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/249969729/assets', 'upload_url': 'https://uploads.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/249969729/assets{?name,label}', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/tag/v0.56.0', 'id': 249969729, 'author': {'login': 'gjcope', 'id': 22783547, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzgzNTQ3', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'node_id': 'RE_kwDOCQhX4M4O5jxB', 'tag_name': 'v0.56.0', 'target_commitish': 'master', 'name': 'Feature Release: HDRI Lighting', 'draft': False, 'immutable': False, 'prerelease': False, 'created_at': '2025-09-26T17:13:40Z', 'updated_at': '2025-09-26T17:29:13Z', 'published_at': '2025-09-26T17:15:40Z', 'assets': [{'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/assets/297617227', 'id': 297617227, 'node_id': 'RA_kwDOCQhX4M4RvUdL', 'name': 'voyager-tools-v0.56.0.zip', 'label': None, 'uploader': {'login': 'gjcope', 'id': 22783547, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzgzNTQ3', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 13380953, 'digest': 'sha256:aa08c68f77585cb223d6f0fb9b5c6e9ee4ed3114d4a6859949906ac0bbc98062', 'download_count': 3, 'created_at': '2025-09-26T17:29:05Z', 'updated_at': '2025-09-26T17:29:13Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.56.0/voyager-tools-v0.56.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.56.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.56.0', 'body': "Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* An 'EnvironmentLight' object has been added that controls lighting generated from the loaded environment map\r\n  * EnvironmentLight will be present in all scenes, but disabled for legacy scene files without roughness or metalness maps.\r\n  * The default scene template (used by standalone mode) will default to active EnvironmentLight and tone mapping and two disabled directional lights that can be enabled for shadow casting or supplemental lighting purposes\r\n* Custom environment maps can now be added to a scene file as Image assets with 'usage' set to 'Environment'\r\n  * HDR format equirectangular images are supported with a recommended resolution of 1k\r\n  * Future development will include adding a custom map via the Voyager Story UI\r\n* Environment maps can now be rendered as the scene background and rotated via scene settings\r\n* All lights can now be enabled/disabled\r\n* Shadow casting lights now include a shadow 'intensity' parameter. This can be useful in conjunction with environment lighting, which doesn't cast shadows, to add a shadow without contributing significantly to the overall light.\r\n* Arabic has been added as a language option\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Grid transparency now works as expected\r\n* Fix for bug when changing camera projection from camera settings \r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* The tone mapping option now uses the [Neutral](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/ToneMapping/blob/main/PBR_Neutral/README.md#pbr-neutral-specification) algorithm\r\n* Refactor to augment core material shaders rather than relying on custom implementations for easier updating\r\n  * **Note:** This includes reverting a custom ambient occlusion implementation which should provide more accurate shading but may result in less intense AO in legacy scenes. If needed, this can be compensated for with the AO intensity setting."}
