thubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 10861143, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 11, 'created_at': '2024-07-26T14:02:18Z', 'updated_at': '2024-07-26T14:02:27Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.43.0/voyager-tools-v0.43.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.43.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.43.0', 'body': "Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Annotations now fully accessible via keyboard controls and will be announced by a screen reader on opening.\r\n* Help screen fully accessible via keyboard and screen reader.\r\n* Copyright is now settable via the Collection panel in Story and will persist through saves. (@sdumetz)\r\n* Integrated support for ktx2 (basisu) and meshopt decoders. (@sdumetz)\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Fixed bug that was overwriting overlay maps when working with multi-model scenes.\r\n* Fixed property regressions that caused #293 & #294.\r\n* Addressed #290 by updating the scene bounds whenever a model's visibility changes.\r\n* Fixed #287 by handling mouse release on a splitter with no previous mouse down.\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Unused file cleanup (@sdumetz)\r\n* ff-* libraries moved to source tree (@sdumetz)\r\n* node-sass module replaced with sass to improve compatibility and address vulnerabilities (@sdumetz)", 'mentions_count': 1}
