atars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 7950110, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 21, 'created_at': '2022-02-02T15:46:12Z', 'updated_at': '2022-02-02T15:46:18Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.15.0/voyager-tools-v0.15.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.15.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.15.0', 'body': 'Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Tab navigation for all Explorer UI elements\r\n* Additional keyboard navigation support (arrow keys, esc, etc.) where appropriate and recommended by [WC3 WAI authoring practices](https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-practices-1.1)\r\n* Screen reader support for all UI elements (optimized for NVDA)\r\n* Narration feature - UI and backend support for playing an audio file providing additional context to the scene.\r\n\r\n**API Updates:**\r\n* New functions\r\n  * GetCameraOffset/SetCameraOffset\r\n  * GetAnnotations\r\n  * SetActiveAnnotation\r\n  * SetTourStep\r\n* New Explorer component attributes\r\n  * bgColor - background color\r\n  * bgStyle - background style\r\n  * controls - enables/disables mouse control of camera\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Added support for css resize to component renderer\r\n* Workaround for [iOS texture memory issue](https://discourse.threejs.org/t/textures-in-gltf-sometimes-display-black-but-only-on-ios/30520/26)\r\n* #117 - style fix\r\n* #59 - iOS/Safari bug - workaround added\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Added examples in documentation for all new API functions and attributes\r\n* Updated Three.js to 0.136.0. (**NOTE** - This release removed gamma support from the WebGL renderer. Some models may appear slightly lighter)\r\n* Added vars to the .env file to configure the network address and subnet used when spinning up the included server. (**NOTE** - If using the server with an existing Docker container, you will most likely need to update the .env and restart your container)'}
