: 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 5359807, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 13, 'created_at': '2021-04-16T16:50:42Z', 'updated_at': '2021-04-16T16:50:47Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.12.1/voyager-tools-v0.12.1.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.12.1', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.12.1', 'body': 'Changelog:\r\n\r\n* Expanded [Explorer API](https://smithsonian.github.io/dpo-voyager/explorer/api/) \r\n    * New Attributes\r\n        * uiMode - define what ui elements are visible on load\r\n    * New Methods\r\n        * toggleAnnotations(), toggleReader(), toggleTours(), toggleTools()\r\n        * enableAR()\r\n        * getArticles()\r\n        * getCameraOrbit(), setCameraOrbit()\r\n        * setBackgroundColor(), setBackgroundStyle()\r\n* Bug Fixes\r\n    * #45 - new tags default to on\r\n    * #46 - normalized annotation scale and offset\r\n    * Adjusted near plane for small AR objects\r\n    * Enforced a minimum AR interaction plane size\r\n    * #70 Updated picking to work with multi-mesh files. Includes modifying Tape and Annotation tools to accommodate all transforms in their graph.\r\n* Dependency update to address security issue (is-svg)'}
