thubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 9765250, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 14, 'created_at': '2023-04-27T18:44:34Z', 'updated_at': '2023-04-27T18:44:39Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.28.0/voyager-tools-v0.28.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.28.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.28.0', 'body': "Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Support for all Three.js Standard Material properties (@sdumetz)\r\n* Image captions enabled in article editor (found on image details panel)\r\n* Added API function to open an article based on ID (#192)\r\n  *  setActiveArticle()\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Lights now auto-position and scale based on scene units. (#88)\r\n  * Light helpers also scale\r\n* Shadow scale and quality auto-adjust to scene size/units. (#8)\r\n* Article put/get mime type standardized (#202)\r\n* Fixed odd drag/drop behavior (#200)\r\n* 'doubleSided' material property override responsiveness fixed\r\n* More responsive Story header (@pakrettt)\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Added documentation/example for setActiveArticle()", 'mentions_count': 2}
