ercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 9759034, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 14, 'created_at': '2023-02-23T17:11:02Z', 'updated_at': '2023-02-23T17:11:08Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.26.0/voyager-tools-v0.26.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.26.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.26.0', 'body': 'Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Logo and spinner graphics now customizable (#160)\r\n  * Added new default non-Smithsonian logo/spinner\r\n  * See [documentation for how-to walkthrough](https://smithsonian.github.io/dpo-voyager/explorer/branding/)\r\n* Additional attributes now animatable in tours\r\n  * Material roughness value\r\n  * Material metalness value\r\n  * Slicer color\r\n  * Reader position\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Fixed memory leak with shadow casting lights\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Misc dependency updates to address vulnerabilities (Three.js to v0.149.0)\r\n* Added documentation for logo/spinner customizing'}
