actory', 'id': 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 3075225, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 9, 'created_at': '2019-04-19T17:43:53Z', 'updated_at': '2019-04-19T17:43:55Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.6.0/voyager-tools-v0.6.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.6.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.6.0', 'body': "- Article editor: new task to create articles using the built-in rich text editor. Articles can be displayed in the article reader, a transparent overlay on top of the scene view. Annotations can be linked with articles via link in the annotation's text.\r\n- Media manager: The new media manager helps organizing article media files such as images. Media can be uploaded and inserted into articles via drag and drop.\r\n- Lots of fixes and improvements"}
