, 'id': 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 2956169, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 9, 'created_at': '2019-04-19T17:43:26Z', 'updated_at': '2019-04-19T17:43:27Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.5.0/voyager-tools-v0.5.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.5.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.5.0', 'body': 'This release brings a big change in the document data structure and a major new feature: tours!\r\n- New unified document format: The new format replaces the `item.json` and `presentation.json` files with a universal scene description format. The new Voyager document format is 99% compatible with glTF, and therefore easy to understand and read for everyone with prior exposure to the well-established glTF format. In the future we might add tools for converting between `document.json` and glTF.\r\n- With the new document format, Voyager introduces new URL variables:\r\n  - `root` specifies the root folder for all assets, including the base document, relative to the page URL\r\n  - `document` specifies the path to the `document.json` to load, relative to the root\r\n  - The remaining variables `model`, `geometry`, and `texture` work as before (all relative to the root)\r\n- New tour editor: Voyager story comes with a new built-in task to create and edit guided tours. A tour is a sequence of snapshot steps, state captures of the Voyager viewer. When playing a tour, similar to a power-point presentation, the user moves forward (or backward) from step to step. All Voyager properties captured (such as camera position, lights, etc.) are seamlessly animated between steps.\r\n- Lots of fixes and improvements'}
