ars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 9761810, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 12, 'created_at': '2023-03-31T14:58:01Z', 'updated_at': '2023-03-31T14:58:07Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.27.0/voyager-tools-v0.27.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.27.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.27.0', 'body': "Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Decoupled drag/drop functionality from Standalone mode so that it can be used in conjunction with a backend filesystem\r\n  * This feature is enabled by adding the ['dragdrop' attribute](https://smithsonian.github.io/dpo-voyager/explorer/api/) to your Voyager Story component\r\n  * Enabled by default in Standalone mode\r\n  * **Important** - Voyager does *not* handle access control so enabling this feature increases the importance of securing your server-side I/O.\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Linked names between article asset and object to address #193 \r\n  * Changing an article asset name will update any URIs referencing it\r\n  * Bad article URIs display an error message to the user\r\n* Disabled asset tree drag/drop in standalone mode\r\n* Fixed #157 by filtering 'scene-default' snapshots from loaded files\r\n* Fixed issue where model navigation was blocked by open annotations\r\n* Enabled text selection in articles to address #175\r\n* Updated html list styles so article editor better matches published content\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Added documentation for dragdrop API attribute\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"}
