s.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 7830863, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 15, 'created_at': '2021-09-30T14:00:54Z', 'updated_at': '2021-09-30T14:01:02Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.14.1/voyager-tools-v0.14.1.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.14.1', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.14.1', 'body': "Changelog:\r\n\r\nBug Fixes:\r\n* #7 - Added auto-sizing option for floor. Will require re-examining any scenes actively showing the floor object.\r\n* #18 - Model attached to ticket now rendering correctly with all faces\r\n* #44 - Scene state saving separated from scene data saving in Story. Scene state saving now happens under 'Capture' tab.\r\n* #47 - Article editor now behaves like other editor panes in Story. Selecting an article from the list will automatically open it in the editor.\r\n* #51 - Deleting an article from the article tab now removes 'Read more' links from any annotations referencing that article. *Note* - Deleting from the media manager will result in an error message, which is the intended result.\r\n* #87 - Exposure slider now works with addition of tone mapping.\r\n* #89 - Alternate language articles are created the same way as default language.\r\n* #94 - Padding adjusted on articles.\r\n* #96 - Extended annotations transition for smoothly.\r\n* Added sanity checks for valid file paths before making WebDav requests.\r\n\r\nNew Features:\r\n* #25 - Italics supported in scene titles\r\n  * HTML user inputs now sanitized in Story to avoid malicious code\r\n* Tone mapping enabled (hard coded to ACES)\r\n* Explorer 'root' attribute can now be changed on the fly to reload the active scene."}
