amefactory', 'id': 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 107204104, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 357, 'created_at': '2019-07-22T15:34:00Z', 'updated_at': '2019-07-22T15:34:20Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.7.0/voyager-demo-assets.zip'}, {'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/assets/13847078', 'id': 13847078, 'node_id': 'MDEyOlJlbGVhc2VBc3NldDEzODQ3MDc4', 'name': 'voyager-tools-v0.7.0.zip', 'label': None, 'uploader': {'login': 'framefactory', 'id': 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 3417756, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 16, 'created_at': '2019-07-22T14:52:10Z', 'updated_at': '2019-07-22T14:52:12Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.7.0/voyager-tools-v0.7.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.7.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.7.0', 'body': 'This release introduces tag support. Models and annotations can be given a number of tags. As soon as tags are present in a scene, a tag cloud appears when enabling annotations. The user can then select models and annotations based on tags. The current tag selection can be recorded and animated in tours.\r\n\r\nExample scene with tags:\r\n[Neil Armstrong Spacesuit](https://3d.si.edu/armstrong-spacesuit_media/index.html)\r\n\r\n- Tag support for models and annotations\r\n- Individual colors for annotations\r\n- Updated dependencies\r\n- Updated main menu, tours on top, article reader second\r\n- Annotations and tools disabled during tours\r\n- Tour menu called at the end of a tour\r\n- Lots of fixes and improvements\r\n\r\n#### Demo Assets\r\nThe download section of this release contains a ZIP file with four demo models, ready to be displayed in Voyager. Please see the `README.txt` in the ZIP for instructions.'}
