ctory', 'id': 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 3978267, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 10, 'created_at': '2019-06-24T20:14:45Z', 'updated_at': '2019-06-24T20:14:47Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.6.4/voyager-tools-v0.6.4.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.6.4', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.6.4', 'body': '#### Fixes and updates in Voyager Explorer\r\n- Fixed: black/flickering wire frame display on some mobile devices\r\n- Fixed: annotations not fully visible in first redraw after switching on\r\n- Fixed: Simple annotation type no longer clickable\r\n- Fixed: accidental text selection on mobile devices\r\n\r\n#### Fixes and updates in Voyager Story\r\n- Fixed: low accuracy when placing/moving annotations\r\n- Fixed: bug in zoom extent preventing proper centering\r\n- Updated: derivatives task - separate per part switching between derivatives\r\n\r\n#### Documentation\r\n- Documentation initial release published on Github pages, using Hugo static CMS'}
