: 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 3186953, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 9, 'created_at': '2019-05-04T14:30:19Z', 'updated_at': '2019-05-04T14:30:21Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.6.2/voyager-tools-v0.6.2.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.6.2', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.6.2', 'body': 'This is mainly a fix release containing lots of improvements and small fixes.\r\n * Settings task: In Voyager story, a new task "settings" provides access to scene and model parameters. Click the settings task button, then select a node in the scene tree to see and adjust its parameters.\r\n* Wireframe now rendered in consistent color\r\n* The size of the pins of the measurement tape scales with the scene size.\r\n* The LOD algorithm now takes the device\'s maximum texture resolution into account when deciding which derivative to load.\r\n* The way light source transforms are applied changes in this release. Documents created in previous versions need to adjust the position and orientation of their light sources.'}
