': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 11049815, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 15, 'created_at': '2025-04-25T14:51:30Z', 'updated_at': '2025-04-25T14:51:36Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.51.0/voyager-tools-v0.51.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.51.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.51.0', 'body': "Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Support for glTF material 'variants' in loaded models ([Variant Extension](https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF/blob/main/extensions/2.0/Khronos/KHR_materials_variants/README.md))\r\n  * This allows different materials variations included in glTF models to be swapped in and out\r\n  * Variants will dynamically populate in the Explorer 'Material' tool menu for access by the end user\r\n  * Variants can be changed as part of a tour transition\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Fix for misaligned annotations bodies when annotations are opened out of view bounds\r\n* Reset button now auto-zooms if used in standalone mode\r\n* Fix for audio captions not showing in Firefox\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Node version for the Docker image updated to 22.14.0"}
