url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 11034624, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 21, 'created_at': '2025-03-28T17:30:18Z', 'updated_at': '2025-03-28T17:30:23Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.50.0/voyager-tools-v0.50.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.50.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.50.0', 'body': 'Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Two new first-person navigation modes are introduced, "Walk" and "Fly"\r\n  * Useful for scenes where the focus is an environment and not an object\r\n  * "Walk" is the same interaction paradigm as "Fly", but constrains movement to the x/z horizontal plane\r\n  * Based on the orbit/offset scheme used for "Orbit" mode, so fully compatible with tours and other modes\r\n  * New modes can also be fully controlled with the keyboard\r\n  * Help screen updated to reflect these modes\r\n  * We welcome any ideas/suggestions for other useful navigation modes. **Please open an issue or discussion to propose** \r\n* A "Reset" button has been added to reset the scene state to initial load\r\n  * Currently does not reset lights or model movement\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Added back bounds calculation to fix #351/#352\r\n* v0.49.0 tour creation regression fixed\r\n* Annotations no longer display when behind the camera \r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Dependency updates to address vulnerabilities'}
