s.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 9492994, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 11, 'created_at': '2022-05-02T18:58:03Z', 'updated_at': '2022-05-02T18:58:11Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.17.0/voyager-tools-v0.17.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.17.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.17.0', 'body': 'Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Integration of TinyMCE editor for article editing \r\n  * Supports image imports and drag/drop\r\n  * Direct media embed\r\n\r\n**API Updates:**\r\n* New events\r\n  * model-load - fires after each individual model load\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* near/far planes now auto-calculate based on object size\r\n  * zoom out is also automatically restricted accordingly\r\n* #65 Fixed issue with calculation of bounding box being saved to scene. **Note** this update requires re-saving existing scenes to apply.\r\n* #123 Added flatShaded support so models with no normals do not render black.\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Hard-coded AR camera near and far planes to avoid unit changes\r\n* Added examples in documentation for all API updates\r\n* Dependency updates to address vulnerabilities'}
