ctory', 'id': 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 4387572, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 21, 'created_at': '2019-12-17T12:29:55Z', 'updated_at': '2019-12-17T12:30:03Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.7.5/voyager-tools-v0.7.5.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.7.5', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.7.5', 'body': "This release ensures compatibility with [Concierge](https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-concierge), the migration and workflow tool.\r\n\r\nChangelog:\r\n- Updated documentation\r\n- Added support for occlusion and normal maps in URL query and startup options \r\n- Added support for hiding the entire main menu\r\n- Fixed a bug where some buttons were disable during editing\r\n- Fixed a bug in the article editor where absolute URLs weren't properly converted\r\n- Fixed a bug where the shadow resolution wasn't serialized properly\r\n- Fixed a bug where switching the shader on a model without normal maps caused a shader compilation error\r\n- Lots of minor fixes and improvements"}
