thubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 11569585, 'digest': 'sha256:3edc8e007b6d495c35f4ef30088da17bb9a6f803b0b9d73028c460d29b9a8199', 'download_count': 3, 'created_at': '2025-07-31T17:52:16Z', 'updated_at': '2025-07-31T17:52:23Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.54.0/voyager-tools-v0.54.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.54.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.54.0', 'body': 'Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Italics supported in article and tour titles\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Action task added to Story standalone mode\r\n* Ortho zoom bug fix (#349)\r\n* Mimetype now guessed when not defined for assets loaded from scene file\r\n* Loading spinner now works again in Story standalone mode\r\n* Click actions disabled when measure tool is active\r\n* Schema validation fail with Italian language resolved (@Inao0)\r\n* Audio and camera projection correctly reset\r\n\r\n**Misc**\r\n* Dependencies updated to address vulnerabilities\r\n  * Three.js to v0.169.0\r\n* Memory leak cleanups (@sdumetz)\r\n* Improved alignment between article editor and article viewer styles', 'mentions_count': 2}
[2025-11-26 08:58:04,107] DEBUG in messages: r={'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/229755614', 'assets_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/229755614/assets', 'upload_url': 'https://uploads.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/229755614/assets{?name,label}', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/tag/v0.53.0', 'id': 229755614, 'author': {'login': 'gjcope', 'id': 22783547, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzgzNTQ3', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'node_id': 'RE_kwDOCQhX4M4Nscre', 'tag_name': 'v0.53.0', 'target_commitish': 'master', 'name': 'Feature Release: Action Manager & Streaming LOD', 'draft': False, 'immutable': False, 'prerelease': False, 'created_at': '2025-07-03T16:55:26Z', 'updated_at': '2025-07-03T17:16:48Z', 'published_at': '2025-07-03T17:09:00Z', 'assets': [{'url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/assets/269707009', 'id': 269707009, 'node_id': 'RA_kwDOCQhX4M4QE2cB', 'name': 'voyager-tools-v0.53.0.zip', 'label': None, 'uploader': {'login': 'gjcope', 'id': 22783547, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzgzNTQ3', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22783547?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/gjcope', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/gjcope/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/x-zip-compressed', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 11560886, 'digest': 'sha256:f43c108ceb222d97c7235ebe811d4963177595ec4fa2a9dfa77f335f9b202d8b', 'download_count': 9, 'created_at': '2025-07-03T17:16:42Z', 'updated_at': '2025-07-03T17:16:48Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.53.0/voyager-tools-v0.53.0.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.53.0', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.53.0', 'body': "Changelog:\r\n\r\n**New Features:**\r\n* Action task added to Story\r\n  * This allows scene creators to link triggers with actions for more dynamic user-drive experiences.\r\n  * Current triggers are model-click, scene load, and annotation activation.\r\n  * Current actions include playing top-level object animations. Future development will support playing audio clips and more.  \r\n  * We recommend any model-click driven animation also include an annotation trigger for the animation so it is accessible by keyboard controls as well.\r\n* Streaming Level of Detail (@sdumetz , @inao0)\r\n  * Dynamically upgrades and downgrades the quality of objects in the scene based on visual importance. This allows for a better user experience with larger and more complex scenes.\r\n  * This requires multiple model derivatives to be defined and available in a scene. Voyager **does not** generate LOD assets itself.\r\n  * This feature is off by default and can be enabled in scene settings under Derivatives Selection>LOD.\r\n\r\n**Bug fixes:**\r\n* Objects with small bounds now appropriately zoom when loaded in standalone mode\r\n* Doublesided material override now loads correctly from file\r\n* Spurious narration audio warning message when no audio present resolved\r\n* Material caching memory leak patched\r\n\r\n**Misc:**\r\n* Language manager refactored for more clarity and separation of 'default' scene language and 'active' scene language (@inao0)\r\n* Dependency updates", 'mentions_count': 2}
