', 'id': 550450, 'node_id': 'MDQ6VXNlcjU1MDQ1MA==', 'avatar_url': 'https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/550450?v=4', 'gravatar_id': '', 'url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory', 'html_url': 'https://github.com/framefactory', 'followers_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/followers', 'following_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/following{/other_user}', 'gists_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/gists{/gist_id}', 'starred_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/starred{/owner}{/repo}', 'subscriptions_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/subscriptions', 'organizations_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/orgs', 'repos_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/repos', 'events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/events{/privacy}', 'received_events_url': 'https://api.github.com/users/framefactory/received_events', 'type': 'User', 'user_view_type': 'public', 'site_admin': False}, 'content_type': 'application/octet-stream', 'state': 'uploaded', 'size': 4383079, 'digest': None, 'download_count': 18, 'created_at': '2019-10-25T10:43:21Z', 'updated_at': '2019-10-25T10:43:29Z', 'browser_download_url': 'https://github.com/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/releases/download/v0.7.1/voyager-tools-v0.7.1.zip'}], 'tarball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/tarball/v0.7.1', 'zipball_url': 'https://api.github.com/repos/Smithsonian/dpo-voyager/zipball/v0.7.1', 'body': 'This release introduces a new annotation style. Annotations using the "Circle" style display small circles with numbers, similar to annotations on Sketchfab. Clicking the number displays a popup with additional details.\r\n\r\nChangelog:\r\n- Changed default document name to `document.svx.json`\r\n- New story task mode `Edit` displaying all tasks from `QC` and `Author` modes\r\n- Fixed gamma correction for glTF assets\r\n- New global gamma adjustment parameter'}
